OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers will
OL,6,Fcontinue to spread across the region
OL,7,Fthis evening, heavy with a risk of
OL,8,Fthunder, before easing from the west
OL,9,Fovernight. Staying rather cloudy, with
OL,10,Fhill fog in parts of Derbyshire. A few
OL,11,Fshowers remain possible by dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FEarly cloud breaking to sunny
OL,14,Fspells. Breezy with scattered showers
OL,15,Faround lunchtime, perhaps heavy.
OL,16,FShowers slowly easing from the west
OL,17,Fduring the afternoon, with winds
OL,18,Ffalling lighter through the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
